# Vulnerabilities in npm bundled with the official Node.js Docker image.
# These are NOT in our application code — they exist in /usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/.
# We accept the risk until the Node.js image maintainers release a patched build.
# Reviewed: 2026-02-20

# minimatch ReDoS in npm's bundled copy (fixed in minimatch >=10.2.1)
CVE-2026-26996

# tar path traversal in npm's bundled copy (fixed in tar >=7.5.8)
CVE-2026-26960
